--- a/tmux.1
+++ b/tmux.1
@@ -4489,6 +4489,14 @@
 .Sx STYLES
 section.
 .Pp
+.It Xo Ic mouse-auto-reset
+.Op Ic on | off
+.Xc
+Keep application mouse and focus reporting with the foreground job in each pane.
+Reporting is disabled when another job takes the foreground, and restored when
+a stopped job resumes. Dead jobs cannot restore their modes.
+This is on by default. Turn it off for deliberate mode inheritance between jobs.
+Bracketed paste and the session-level mouse option are unchanged.
 .It Xo Ic monitor-activity
 .Op Ic on | off
 .Xc
